        mlt:citation "Thompson, D.W. (1917) On Growth and Form. Cambridge University Press. Ch. XVII (fish, generalisation), pp. 748-751, Figs. 373-382." ;
        mlt:claim "IMPLIED GENERALISATION tested by this repo (not a sentence of Thompson's): the four fish families above describe related-fish form difference generally, across taxa and evolutionary time." ;
        mlt:claimId "T1917-050" ;
        mlt:counterclaim "Not applicable to the literature: Thompson never made this generalisation in this form. Its nearest literature relatives are Bookstein (1977) (method intractable) and Scholtz et al. (2020) (simple transformations only). Cite it only as 'Dietz/repo (2026)'." ;
        mlt:dataKindNeeded "IN_REPO (extension, not a 1917 claim)" ;
        mlt:datasetAuditReason "Already validated in repo on data on disk; closed." ;
        mlt:datasetExistence "IN_REPO" ;
